{"content":[{"c":["JESHAIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Hananiah’s son; the father of Rephaiah and a descendant of David through Zerubbabel’s line, who lived in postexilic Palestine (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.21","r":"1Chr.3.21","rawR":"1Chr.3.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.21","value":"1Chr.3.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:21"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Jeduthun’s son and the leader of the eighth of 24 divisions of musicians trained for service in the sanctuary during David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.25.3,15","r":"1Chr.25.3,15","rawR":"1Chr.25.3,15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.25.3,15","value":"1Chr.25.3,15"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 25:3, 15"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Rehabiah’s son and one of the Levites in charge of the temple treasury during David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.26.25","r":"1Chr.26.25","rawR":"1Chr.26.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.26.25","value":"1Chr.26.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 26:25"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Son of Athaliah from the house of Elam, who returned with Ezra to Judah following the Babylonian captivity (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.7","r":"Ezra.8.7","rawR":"Ezra.8.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.7","value":"Ezra.8.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 8:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Levite of the family of Merari, who returned with Ezra to Jerusalem after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.19","r":"Ezra.8.19","rawR":"Ezra.8.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.19","value":"Ezra.8.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 8:19"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Benjamite, Ithiel’s father, and an ancestor of Sallu. Sallu resettled in Jerusalem during the postexilic era (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.7","r":"Neh.11.7","rawR":"Neh.11.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.7","value":"Neh.11.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jeshaiah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 3:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.3.21","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.3.21","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.3.21"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 25:3, 15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.25.3,15","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.25.3,15","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.25.3,15"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 26:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.26.25","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.26.25","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.26.25"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 8:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.8.7","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.8.7","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.8.7"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 8:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.8.19","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.8.19","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.8.19"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.7","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.7","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.7"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"74ec78ea4375ee2dfe944d1e63397ada520a1619e7538d54d411f4f65ab58116","sourceItemName":"Jeshaiah","sourceItemOrder":206,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Jeshaiah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jeshaiah","title":"Jeshaiah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}